<section class="section" aria-labelledby="mcp-heading"
  style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(56,189,248,0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center reveal">
    <div class="split-text">
      <span class="sect-label">MCP Integration</span>
      <h2 id="mcp-heading">Your Secure AI Video Bot <span class="grad-text">in the Cloud</span></h2>
      <p>Connect 10zebra to Claude, ChatGPT, or Cursor via MCP. Generate video from your LLM workflow — without exposing your files, your prompts, or your project data to the model.</p>
      <ul class="feat-list">
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>MCP-compatible</strong> — works with Claude Desktop, ChatGPT, Cursor, and any MCP client.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Sandboxed generation</strong> — your local files and workspace stay untouched. 10zebra generates in its own secure pipeline.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>All models accessible</strong> — leverage all 8+ AI models through a single MCP endpoint.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Project-aware</strong> — generations land directly in your 10zebra storyboard. Budgets and permissions still apply.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <blockquote class="mt-5 pl-5 text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] italic leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-[var(--accent)]">
        &ldquo;Think of it like a dedicated claw machine in the cloud. Your LLM tells 10zebra what to grab — which model, which prompt, which references — and 10zebra reaches in, generates the media, and delivers it back to your project. Your computer stays untouched.&rdquo;
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <div class="glass p-8 text-center">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 items-center">
        <div class="mcp-node w-full max-w-xs py-3 px-6 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold"
          style="background:rgba(129,140,248,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(129,140,248,0.25); color:var(--accent-secondary);">
          ?? Claude / ChatGPT / Cursor
        </div>
        <div class="text-[var(--text-muted)] text-xl">&darr;</div>
        <div class="mcp-node w-full max-w-xs py-3 px-6 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold"
          style="background:var(--accent-subtle); border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.25); color:var(--accent);">
          ?? MCP Server (Secure Bridge)
        </div>
        <div class="text-[var(--text-muted)] text-xl">&darr;</div>
        <div class="mcp-node w-full max-w-xs py-3 px-6 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold"
          style="background:rgba(56,189,248,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.3); color:var(--text-primary);">
          ? 10zebra Cloud &mdash; 8+ AI Models
        </div>
        <div class="text-[var(--text-muted)] text-xl">&darr;</div>
        <div class="mcp-node w-full max-w-xs py-3 px-6 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold"
          style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.25); color:#34d399;">
          ? Generated Media &rarr; Your Project
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
